+/**
+ * Modal dialog with three [Slider]s for the visual preferences held in
+ * [OverlayPrefs]. Live-updates the state as the user drags ΓÇö every
+ * button/stick composable observes [OverlayPrefs] so changes flow
+ * through immediately without needing "Apply".
