+ * Ranges:
+ *  - ΘÇÅµÿÄσ║ª (alpha): 0.3 (very see-through) .. 1.0 (fully opaque)
+ *  - σñºσ░Å (scale):   0.75 .. 1.5 (multiplier applied to every Dp)
+ *  - auto-hide:      0 (disabled) .. 30 seconds. 0 = always visible.
